  "usage_note": "The traditional rule limits **between** to two things and **among** to three or more, but **between** is standard for three or more when each one relates to each of the others individually (*trade between the member countries*); **among** fits a group considered as a whole (*divide the money among the team*).",
  "learner_errors": [
